     "html": "<math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑩</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>J</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒚</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mi>.</mi></mrow></math>"
