     "html": "<math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒎</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑩</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒙</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>J</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒚</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mo>→</mo><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝑭</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></math>"
