     "html": "Momentu angeluarraren dentsitatea <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">ℓ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒓</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒈</mi></mrow></math> da, eta <span class=\"j-mat-luzea\"><math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒓</mi><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒓</mi><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒓</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">𝒓</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mi>θ</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace><mover><mi>r</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></math></span> identitatea erabiliz, <math display=\"inline\"><mi>z</mi></math> osagaia bakarrik geratzen da integrazioan:"
