     "html": "eta gero <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></math> aldaketaz,"
